      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I noted here a VRC Unity VideoPlayer attaches the Video Player component at runtime and tried to see if I could manipulate Playback Speed using Animator instead of Udon and it worked.\nhttps://twitter.com/Yodokor0/status/1523303172399583233\nNeeded Animator.Rebind() before change value.\nThis solution is still hacky so I need this feature as official yet.\nAnd I did'n tried for streaming and AVPro. Someone please try it if you interested.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
